#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:5
#: 28425015c4e2457aa2774a04843befbd
msgid "Holybro H-RTK M8P GNSS"
msgstr "Holybro H-RTK M8P GNSS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:11
#: 11c518418e4649d890694ff383168c6d
msgid ""
"The `Holybro H-RTK M8P GNSS <http://www.holybro.com/product/h-rtk-m8p-rover-"
"lite/>`_  is an RTK GNSS module for mass market by Holybro. This family is "
"similar to the :ref:`common-holybro-rtk-f9p` family but uses the smaller, "
"lighter, and less expensive M8P Ublox RTK GNSS module which still provides "
"far superior position resolution than previous generations."
msgstr ""
"`Holybro H-RTK M8P GNSS <http://www.holybro.com/product/h-rtk-m8p-rover-"
"lite/>`_ 是 Holybro 面向大众市场推出的 RTK GNSS 模块。该系列与 :ref:`common-holybro-rtk-f9p` "
"系列类似，但采用更小、更轻、更经济的 M8P Ublox RTK GNSS 模块，定位精度仍远优于上一代产品。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:13
#: a256bc0a6a704330914cfdc7f1b197f1
msgid ""
"Using RTK allows ArduPilot to get its position with centimeter-level "
"accuracy, which is much more accurate than can be provided by a normal GPS."
msgstr "使用 RTK 可使 ArduPilot 获得厘米级定位精度，远优于普通 GPS 所能提供的精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:15
#: 987d84df05ff40df959facb94c0cf751
msgid ""
"There are three models of Holybro H-RTK M8P to choose from, each with "
"different antenna design to meet different needs:"
msgstr "Holybro H-RTK M8P 有三种型号可供选择，每种型号的天线设计不同，以满足不同需求："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:22
#: a96de1859ec2444baae129858e5cb2f5
msgid "Pin Map"
msgstr "引脚图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:29
#: 79e88623bdce4129bbf35c31ecaa766f
msgid "Wiring and Connections"
msgstr "接线与连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:31
#: f30dd5ed903b4befbc910feb38098c93
msgid ""
"All H-RTK GNSS models come with a GH 10-pin connector/cable that is "
"compatible with the Pixhawk family and many other autopilots."
msgstr "所有 H-RTK GNSS 型号均配备 GH 10 针连接器/线缆，与 Pixhawk 系列及众多其他飞控兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:33
#: c9e01fbc0ee94b8d95c186037809af40
msgid ""
"The cables/connectors may be modified to connect to other autopilot boards, "
"using the Pin Map information provided above."
msgstr "线缆/连接器可使用上述引脚图信息进行改造，以连接其他飞控板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:36
#: 3006d37b25f84d9dbbcf33967d2f2a88
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:38
#: 90d649065d7e4352bed4a303e01cb4cc
msgid ""
"For normal operation, ArduPilot's GPS parameter defaults will work for any "
"serial port configured for ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 5."
msgstr "正常使用时，ArduPilot 的 GPS 参数默认值适用于配置为 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 5 的任意串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:40
#: 5386bac731d6476891f7285aa77465f5
msgid ""
"If you are unable to preform a normal compass calibration (\"compass "
"dance\") for any reason, set parameter COMPASS_ORIENT=6 (Yaw270) for proper "
"compass orientation."
msgstr "如果因任何原因无法执行正常罗盘校准（「罗盘舞」），请设置参数 COMPASS_ORIENT=6（Yaw270）以获得正确的罗盘方向。"

